  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3108.07 Experience",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3108.07 Experience.\n\n(a) Persons in charge of an approved drivers’ school shall have at least 65 hours prior supervised driver education experience in actively instructing driver education, as provided in Saf-C 3105.02(b).\n\n(b) Persons in charge of an approved drivers’ school shall have at least one calendar year of prior supervised driver education experience in a New Hampshire approved drivers’ school.\n\n(c) A driver education provisional certificate holder shall not own, operate, or manage an approved drivers’ school.\n\n(d) Operators and persons in charge of an approved drivers’ school shall submit documentation of a minimum of 2 full classroom programs to the department.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3110.05); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3111.07) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100); ss by #14329, eff 7-23-25, EXPIRES: 7-23-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3100.html"
